---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Experience — Mohammed Fawaz">
  <h1 class="section-title">EXPERIENCE</h1>

  <div class="exp-header">
    <span class="exp-role">Research &amp; Development Intern (Robotics)</span>
    <span class="exp-org">AIRAT Systems LLP, Karnataka, India</span>
    <span class="exp-period">January 2026 – June 2026</span>
  </div>

  <p class="exp-intro">Worked on the mechanical development and hardware/software integration of a desktop animatronic robot and an arecanut grading machine.</p>

  <section class="phase">
    <h2>Desktop Animatronic Robot</h2>
    <p>Developed and built the mechanical structure from an open-source model, using SolidWorks and Fusion 360 for the base and housing. Selected and configured Raspberry Pi 4 and NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano Super hardware for face tracking and a cloud AI interface for human-robot interaction.</p>
    <p>Developed a multithreaded Python control system to run computer-vision face tracking, speech-to-text processing, and I2C servo actuation through the PCA9685 driver in parallel. Integrated Groq API function calling for tool use during conversation, reducing average response latency to approximately 1.1 seconds.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="phase">
    <h2>ArecaSort V1</h2>
    <p>Led development of the arecanut grading and sorting machine, creating the initial design in SolidWorks and preparing image datasets. Built and annotated a custom dataset covering four quality grades and evaluated architectures including YOLOv8, YOLOv10, ResNet-50, and EfficientDet.</p>
    <p>Selected and optimised YOLOv10 with TensorRT FP16, reaching approximately 91% classification accuracy during model testing. Built a Raspberry Pi 5 test model to check the mechanical sorting mechanism, with successful test results.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .section-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .exp-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .exp-role { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--line-bright); }
  .exp-org { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .exp-period { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--line); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .exp-intro { line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--line-bright); }
  .phase {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .phase h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .phase p { line-height: 1.7; color: var(--line-bright); }
</style>